  "details": "I have a suggestion for VRChat: have you ever considered producing an official VRChat movie for theatrical release?\n\nA feature film set in the VRChat universe, featuring VRChat avatars, worlds, and the creativity of the community, could be a really interesting way to introduce VRChat to a wider audience.\n\nI would also strongly appreciate Turkish language support for the movie, including Turkish subtitles and, if possible, a professional Turkish dub. It would be great to see Turkish-speaking users represented and able to enjoy the movie in their own language.\n\nI think an official VRChat movie could be a unique project that showcases what makes VRChat special.",
